tr\" style=\"font-weight:normal;font-size:medium;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">08:00 - 09:00 <span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Breakfast </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-weight:normal;font-size:medium;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Oral session</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>(9:00 - 12:30)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">09:00 - 09:40 </span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-size:13px;white-space:pre\"> </span><font size=\"2\">Invited talk: </font></span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">Recent Applications of Deep Boltzmann Machines <a href=\"http://techtalks.tv/talks/recent-applications-of-deep-boltzmann-machines/58082/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[video]</a></font></span></p></b><b style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family:Times;font-weight:normal;font-size:medium;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:36pt;text-indent:36pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:Arial;background-color:transparent;font-style:italic;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>   </span>Ruslan Salakhutdinov</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgb(34,34,34);background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">09:40 - 10:00<span>    <span>    </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238);vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Discrete Restricted Boltzmann Machines</span><a href=\"http://techtalks.tv/talks/discrete-restricted-boltzmann-machines/58083/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">[video]</font></a></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family:Times;font-weight:normal;font-size:medium;margin:0pt 22pt 0pt 36pt;text-indent:36pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:Arial;background-color:transparent;font-style:italic;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>  <span> </span></span>Guido F. Montufar, Jason Morton</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-weight:normal;font-size:13px;color:rgb(34,34,34);background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">10:00 - 10:20<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238);vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Feature grouping from spatially constrained multiplicative interaction</span><a href=\"http://techtalks.tv/talks/feature-grouping-from-spatially-constrained-multiplicative-interaction/58084/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">[video]</font></a></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family:Times;font-weight:normal;font-size:medium;margin:0pt 22pt 0pt 36pt;text-indent:36pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:Arial;background-color:transparent;font-style:italic;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>   </span>Felix Bauer, Roland Memisevic</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family:Times;font-weight:normal;font-size:medium;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">10:20 - 10:50 <span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Break</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family:Times;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">10:50 - 11:30</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-size:13px;white-space:pre\"> </span><font size=\"2\">Invited talk: </font></span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">Learning Compositional Models<a href=\"http://techtalks.tv/talks/learning-compositional-models/58085/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> [video]</a></font></span></p></b><b style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family:Times;font-weight:normal;font-size:medium;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:72pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);background-color:transparent;font-style:italic;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>   </span>Alan Yuille</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-weight:normal;font-size:13px;color:rgb(34,34,34);background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">11:30 - 11:50<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </sp