/awards/sigir-academy/\" class=\"nav-link\">SIGIR Academy</a></li>\n\t<li id=\"menu-item-2026\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-2026\"><a href=\"https://sigir.org/awards/sigir-ecr-awards/\" class=\"nav-link\">SIGIR Early Career Researcher Awards</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-1562\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-has-children menu-item-1562\"><a href=\"https://sigir.org/resources/\" class=\"nav-link\">Resources</a>\n<ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n\t<li id=\"menu-item-1563\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1563\"><a href=\"https://sigir.org/resources/museum/\" class=\"nav-link\">Museum</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-1564\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-has-children menu-item-1564\"><a href=\"https://sigir.org/forum/\" class=\"nav-link\">SIGIR Forum</a>\n<ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n\t<li id=\"menu-item-1565\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1565\"><a href=\"https://sigir.org/forum/editorial-policy-and-forum-editors/\" class=\"nav-link\">Editorial Policy and Forum Editors</a></li>\n\t<li id=\"menu-item-1566\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1566\"><a href=\"https://sigir.org/forum/issues/\" class=\"nav-link\">Issues</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-1567\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1567\"><a href=\"https://sigir.org/sig-irlist/\" class=\"nav-link\">SIG-IRList</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-2676\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-2676\"><a href=\"https://sigir.org/futures/\" class=\"nav-link\">SIGIR Futures</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t</nav><!-- #site-navigation -->\n\n\t\t\t</div><!-- #navbar -->\n\t\t</header><!-- #masthead -->\n\n\t\t<div id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\">\n\n\t<div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n\t\t<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\" role=\"main\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<article id=\"post-22\" class=\"post-22 page type-page status-publish hentry\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"entry-title\">Fact sheet</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Mission Statement</h2>\n<p>SIGIR focuses on all aspects of information storage, retrieval and dissemination, including research strategies, output schemes and system evaluations.</p>\n<h2>Awards</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/awards/#bestpaper\">Best Paper Award</a><br />\n<em>Awarded at the SIGIR Conference &#8211; $1000 (divided evenly among the authors).</em></li>\n<li><a href=\"/awards/#beststudentpaper\">Best Student Paper Award</a><br />\n<em>Awarded at the SIGIR Conference when the Best Paper winner is not a student- $1000 (divided evenly among the authors).</em></li>\n<li><a href=\"/awards/#salton\">Salton Award</a><br />\n<em>Awarded triennially at the SIGIR Conference. (Formerly SIGIR Award).</em></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sigir.org/awards/test-of-time-awards/\">Test of Time Award</a><br />\n<em>Awarded at the SIGIR Conference.</em></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sigir.org/awards/sigir-academy/\">SIGIR Academy</a><br />\n<em>Awarded at the SIGIR Conference to a small group of individuals for their sustained, significant contributions to information retrieval (the &#8220;Class of &lt;Year&gt;&#8221;).</em></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sigir.org/awards/sigir-ecr-awards/\">Early Career Researcher Award</a><br />\n<em>Awarded at the SIGIR Conference to one or more early career researchers for their contributions to research, community engagement, and/or diversity, equity, and inclusion.</em></li>\n<li><a href=\"/awards/#bushaward\">Vannevar Bush Award</a><br />\n<em>Awarded at the JCDL conference. Co-sponsored with SIGWEB.</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Annual Conferences</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Title: </strong><a href=\"/history/\">International ACM/SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development</a><br />\n<strong>Acronym:</strong> ACM/SIGIR <strong>Aprox Dates:</strong> July/August. <strong>Frequency:</strong> 12 months</li>\n<li><strong>Title: </strong><a href=\"/history/\">International ACM SIGIR Conference on Human Information Interaction and Retrieval</a><br />\n<strong>Acronym:</strong> CHIIR <strong>Aprox Dates:</strong> March. <strong>Frequency:</strong> 12 months</li>\n<li><strong>Title: </strong><a href=\"/hosting-chiir/\">ACM SIGIR International Conference on the Theory of Information Retrieval</a><br />\n<strong>Acronym:</strong> ICTIR <strong>Aprox Dates:</strong> Late September. <strong>Frequency:</strong> 12 months</li>\n<li><strong>Title: </strong><a href=\"/hosting-ictir/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Joint Conference on Digital Libraries</a><br />\n<strong>Acronym:</strong> JCDL <strong>Aprox Dates:</strong> June. <strong>Frequency:</strong> 12 months</li>\n<li><strong>Title: </strong><a href=\"http://www.cikmconference.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Conference on Information &amp; Knowledge Management</a><br />\n<strong>Acronym:</strong> CIKM <strong>Aprox Dates:</strong> November. <strong>Frequency:</strong> 12 months</li>\n<li><strong>Title: </strong><a href=\"http://www.wsdm-conference.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Conference on Web Search and Data Mining</a><br />\n<strong>Acronym:</strong> WSDM <strong>Aprox Dates:</strong> February. <strong>Frequency:</strong> 12 months</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Newsletter</h2>\n<p><strong>Name:</strong> SIGIR Forum <strong>Frequency:</strong> Three times per year</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/forum\">Two newsletter issues</a> (June, December)</li>\n<li><a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/toc.cfm?id=SERIES278\">The special issue</a> (the SIGIR conference proceedings, mailed to all members after the SIGIR conference)</li>\n</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<footer class=\"entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</footer><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t\t</article><!-- #post -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\n<div id=\"comments\" class=\"comments-area\">\n\n\t\n\t\n</div><!-- #comments -->\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><!-- #content -->\n\t</div><!-- #primary -->\n\n\n\t\t</div><!-- #main -->\n\t\t<footer id=\"colophon\" class=\"site-footer\" role=\"contentinfo\">\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"secondary\" class=\"sidebar-container\" role=\"complementary\">\n\t\t<div class=\"widget-area\">\n\t\t\t<aside id=\"search-2\" class=\"widget widget_search\"><form role=\"search\" method=\"get\" class=\"search-form\" action=\"https://sigir.org/\">\r\n\t<label>\r\n\t\t<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Find my information...</span>\r\n\t\t<input type=\"search\" class=\"search-field\" placeholder=\"Search\" value=\"\" name=\"s\" title=\"Search\" />\r\n\t</label>\r\n\t<input type=\"submit\" class=\"search-submit\" value=\"Search\" />\r\n</form></aside>\n\t\t<aside id=\"recent-posts-2\" class=\"widget widget_recent_entries\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"widget-title\">Recent Posts</h3>\n\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://sigir.org/announcing-acm-sigir-futures/\">Announcing SIGIR Futures</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://sigir.org/call-for-nominations-for-acm-sigir-academy/\">Call for Nominations for the ACM SIGIR Academy</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://sigir.org/announcing-the-sigir-early-career-researcher-awards/\">Announcing the SIGIR Early Career Researcher Awards</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://sigir.org/sigir-forum-june-2020/\">SIGIR Forum June 2020</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://sigir.org/sigir-forum-june-2018/\">SIGIR Forum June 2018</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\n\t\