-1561\"><a href=\"https://sigir.org/awards/sigir-academy/\" class=\"nav-link\">SIGIR Academy</a></li>\n\t<li id=\"menu-item-2026\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-2026\"><a href=\"https://sigir.org/awards/sigir-ecr-awards/\" class=\"nav-link\">SIGIR Early Career Researcher Awards</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-1562\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-has-children menu-item-1562\"><a href=\"https://sigir.org/resources/\" class=\"nav-link\">Resources</a>\n<ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n\t<li id=\"menu-item-1563\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1563\"><a href=\"https://sigir.org/resources/museum/\" class=\"nav-link\">Museum</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-1564\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-has-children menu-item-1564\"><a href=\"https://sigir.org/forum/\" class=\"nav-link\">SIGIR Forum</a>\n<ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n\t<li id=\"menu-item-1565\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1565\"><a href=\"https://sigir.org/forum/editorial-policy-and-forum-editors/\" class=\"nav-link\">Editorial Policy and Forum Editors</a></li>\n\t<li id=\"menu-item-1566\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1566\"><a href=\"https://sigir.org/forum/issues/\" class=\"nav-link\">Issues</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-1567\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1567\"><a href=\"https://sigir.org/sig-irlist/\" class=\"nav-link\">SIG-IRList</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-2676\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-2676\"><a href=\"https://sigir.org/futures/\" class=\"nav-link\">SIGIR Futures</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t</nav><!-- #site-navigation -->\n\n\t\t\t</div><!-- #navbar -->\n\t\t</header><!-- #masthead -->\n\n\t\t<div id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\">\n\n\t<div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n\t\t<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\" role=\"main\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<article id=\"post-45\" class=\"post-45 page type-page status-publish hentry\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"entry-title\">List of SIGIR Locations and History</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>SIGIR 2025</h2>\n<p>48th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Padua, Italy<br />\nChairs: Nicola Ferro, Maria Maistro, Gabriella Pasi<br />\nProgram Chairs: Omar Alonso, Andrew Trotman, Suzan Verberne<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"https://sigir2025.dei.unipd.it/\">https://sigir2025.dei.unipd.it/</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2024</h2>\n<p>47th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Washington D.C., USA<br />\nChairs: Grace Hui Yang, Hongning Wang, Sam Han<br />\nProgram Chairs: Claudia Hauff, Guido Zuccon, Yi Zhang<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://sigir.org/sigir2024/\">http://sigir.org/sigir2024/</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2023</h2>\n<p>46th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Taipei, Taiwan<br />\nChairs: Hsin-Hsi Chen, Wei-Jou Duh, Hen-Hsen Huang<br />\nProgram Chairs: Makoto P. Kato, Josiane Mothe, Barbara Poblete<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://sigir.org/sigir2023/\">http://sigir.org/sigir2023/</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2022</h2>\n<p>45th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Madrid, Spain<br />\nChairs: Enrique Amigo, Pablo Castells, Julio Gonzalo<br />\nProgram Chairs: Ben Carterette, Shane Culpepper, Gabriella Kazai<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://sigir.org/sigir2022/\">http://sigir.org/sigir2022/</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2021</h2>\n<p>44th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Virtual<br />\nChairs: Fernando Diaz, Chirag Shah, Torsten Suel<br />\nProgram Chairs: Pablo Castells, Rosie Jones, Tetsuya Sakai<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://sigir.org/sigir2021/\">http://sigir.org/sigir2021/</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2020</h2>\n<p>43rd Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Virtual<br />\nChairs: Yi Chang, Xueqi Cheng, Jimmy Huang<br />\nProgram Chairs: Jaap Kamps, Vanessa Murdock, Ji-Rong Wen<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://sigir.org/sigir2020/\">http://sigir.org/sigir2020/</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2019</h2>\n<p>42nd Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Paris, France<br />\nChairs: Max Chevalier, Eric Gaussier, Benjamin Piwowarski<br />\nProgram Chairs: Yoelle Maarek, Jian-Yun Nie, Falk Scholer<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://sigir.org/sigir2019/\">http://sigir.org/sigir2019/</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2018</h2>\n<p>41st Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Ann Arbor, Michigan<br />\nChairs: Kevyn Collins-Thompson, Qiaozhu Mei<br />\nProgram Chairs: Brian Davison, Yiqun Liu, Emine Yilmaz<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://sigir.org/sigir2018/\">http://sigir.org/sigir2018/</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2017</h2>\n<p>40th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Tokyo, Japan<br />\nChairs: Hideo Joho, Noriko Kando, Tetsuya Sakai<br />\nProgram Chairs: Arjen de Vries, Hang Li, Ryen White<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://sigir.org/sigir2017/\">http://sigir.org/sigir2017/</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2016</h2>\n<p>39th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Pisa, Italy<br />\nChairs: Raffaele Perego and Fabrizio Sebastiani<br />\nProgram Chairs: Javed Aslam, Ian Ruthven, Justin Zobel<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://sigir.org/sigir2016/\">http://sigir.org/sigir2016/</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2015</h2>\n<p>38th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Santiago, Chile<br />\nChair: Ricardo Baeza-Yates<br />\nProgram Chairs: Mounia Lalmas, Alistair Moffat, Berthier Ribeiro-Neto<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://sigir2015.org/\">http://sigir2015.org/</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2014</h2>\n<p>37th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Gold Coast, Australia<br />\nChairs: Shlomo Geva and Andrew Trotman<br />\nProgram Chairs: Peter Bruza, Charlie Clarke, Kal Jarvelin<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://sigir.org/sigir2014/\">http://sigir.org/sigir2014/</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2013</h2>\n<p>36th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Dublin, Ireland<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://dl.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=2484028&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 2013 Proceedings</a><br />\nChairs: Páraic Sheridan, Gareth Jones<br />\nProgram Chairs: Maaren de Rijke, Diane Kelly, Tetsuya Sakai<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://sigir2013.ie\">http://www.sigir2013.ie</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2012</h2>\n<p>35th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Portland, Oregon<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://dl.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=2348283&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 2012 Proceedings</a><br />\nChair: Bill Hersh<br />\nProgram Chairs: Jamie Callan, Yoelle Maarek, Mark Sanderson<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://sigir.org/sigir2012/\">http://www.sigir.org/sigir2012/</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2011</h2>\n<p>34th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Beijing