<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=1277741&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 2007 Proceedings</a><br />\nChairs: Wessel Kraaij; Arjen de Vries<br />\nProgram Chairs: Charlie Clarke; Norbert Fuhr; Noriko Kando<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://sigir.org/sigir2007\">http://www.sigir.org/sigir2007</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2006</h2>\n<p>29th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Seattle, USA<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=1148170&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 2006 Proceedings</a><br />\nChair: Efthimis N. Efthimiadis<br />\nProgram Chairs: Susan Dumais, David Hawking, Kalervo Jarvelin<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://sigir.org/sigir2006\">http://www.sigir.org/sigir2006</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2005</h2>\n<p>28th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Salvador, Brazil<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=1076034&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 2005 Proceedings</a><br />\nChairs: Ricardo Baeza-Yates; Nivio Ziviani,<br />\nProgram Chairs: Gary Marchionini, Alistair Moffat, John Tait<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://www.dcc.ufmg.br/eventos/sigir2005/\">http://www.dcc.ufmg.br/eventos/sigir2005/</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2004</h2>\n<p>27th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Sheffield, UK<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=1008992&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 2004 Proceedings</a><br />\nChair: Mark Sanderson<br />\nProgram Chairs: Kalervo Järvelin, James Allan, Peter Bruza<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://sigir.org/sigir2004\">http://www.sigir.org/sigir2004</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 2003</h2>\n<p>26th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Toronto, Canada<br />\nProcee