le, USA<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=215206&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 1995 Proceedings</a><br />\nChair: Raya Fidel<br />\nProgram Chairs: Ed Fox; Peter Ingwersen<br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"http://sigir.org/sigir1995\">http://www.sigir.org/sigir1995</a></p>\n<h2>SIGIR 1994</h2>\n<p>17th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Dublin, Ireland<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=188490&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 1994 Proceedings</a><br />\nChair: Alan Smeaton<br />\nProgram Chairs: Bruce Croft; Keith van Rijsbergen</p>\n<h2>SIGIR 1993</h2>\n<p>16th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Pittsburgh, USA<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=160688&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 1993 Proceedings</a><br />\nChair: Edie Rasmussen<br />\nProgram Chairs: Robert Korfhage; Peter Willett</p>\n<h2>SIGIR 1992</h2>\n<p>15th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Copenhagen, Denmark<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=133160&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 1992 Proceedings</a><br />\nChair: Peter Ingwersen<br />\nProgram Chairs: Nick Belkin; Annelise Mark Pejtersen</p>\n<h2>SIGIR 1991</h2>\n<p>14th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Chicago, USA<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=122860&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 1991 Proceedings</a><br />\nChair: Abraham Bookstein<br />\nProgram Chairs: Yves Chiaramella; Gerard Salton; Vijay Raghavan</p>\n<h2>SIGIR 1990</h2>\n<p>13th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Brussels, Belgium<br />\n