/>\nProgram Chair: Vijay Raghavan</p>\n<h2>SIGIR 1984</h2>\n<p>7th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Cambridge, England<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=636805&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 1984 Proceedings</a><br />\nChair: Steven Pollitt<br />\nProgram Chair: Keith van Rijsbergen</p>\n<h2>SIGIR 1983</h2>\n<p>6th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Washington DC, USA<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=511793&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 1983 Proceedings</a><br />\nChair: Michael J. McGill<br />\nProgram Chair: Matthew Koll</p>\n<h2>SIGIR 1982</h2>\n<p>5th Annual ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Berlin, Germany<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=636713&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 1982 Proceedings</a><br />\nChair: Gerard Salton; Hans-Jochen Schneider<br />\nProgram Chairs: Gerard Salton; Hans-Jochen Schneider</p>\n<h2>SIGIR 1981</h2>\n<p>4th Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Berkeley, USA<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=511754&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 1981 Proceedings</a><br />\nChair: William Cooper<br />\nProgram Chair: Jesse Herr</p>\n<h2>SIGIR 1980</h2>\n<p>3rd Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Cambridge, England<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=636669&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 1980 Proceedings</a><br />\nChair: C.J. van Rijsbergen<br />\nProgram Chairs: Robert Oddy; Stephen Robertson; Keith van Rijsbergen; P.W. Williams</p>\n<h2>SIGIR 1979</h2>\n<p>2nd Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Dallas, USA<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=511706&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 1979 Proceedings</a><br />\nChair: Robert Korfhage<br />\nProgram Chair: Christine Borgman</p>\n<h2>SIGIR 1978</h2>\n<p>1st Annual International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research &amp; Development on Information Retrieval<br />\nLocation: Rochester, USA<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=800096&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 1978 Proceedings</a><br />\nChair: Robert Datolla<br />\nProgram Chairs: James Iverson, P. Bruce Berra, Robert Dattola</p>\n<h2>SIGIR 1971</h2>\n<p>International ACM SIGIR conference on Information Storage and Retrieval<br />\nProceedings: <a href=\"http://portal.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=511285&amp;coll=ACM&amp;dl=ACM\">SIGIR 1971 Proceedings</a><br />\nChair: Jack Minker<br />\nProgram Chair: Samuel Rosenfeld</p>\n<h2>More history</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/museum\">SIGIR Digital Museum of IR Research</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<footer class=\"entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</footer><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t\t</article><!-- #post -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\n<div id=\"comments\" class=\"comments-area\">\n\n\t\n\t\n</div><!-- #comments -->\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><!-- #content -->\n\t</div><!-- #primary -->\n\n\n\t\t</div><!-- #main -->\n\t\t<footer id=\"colophon\" class=\"site-footer\" role=\"contentinfo\">\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"secondary\" class=\"sidebar-container\" role=\"complementary\">\n\t\t<div class=\"widget-area\">\n\t\t\t<aside id=\"search-2\" class=\"widget widget_search\"><form role=\"search\" method=\"get\" class=\"search-form\" action=\"https://sigir.org/\">\r\n\t<label>\r\n\t\t<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Find my information...</span>\r\n\t\t<input type=\"search\" class=\"search-field\" placeholder=\"Search\" value=\"\" name=\"s\" title=\"Search\" />\r\n\t</label>\r\n\t<input type=\"s