column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner vc_custom_1422002848621\">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_raw_code wpb_content_element wpb_raw_html\">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<p>The ACM Special Interest Group on Management of Data is concerned with the principles, techniques and applications of database management systems and data management technology. Our members include software developers, academic and industrial researchers, practitioners, users, and students. SIGMOD sponsors the annual SIGMOD/PODS conference, one of the most important and selective in the field.</p>\n<p>Use the menu above to navigate to a specific section; below are some popular destinations.</p>\n<table class=\"noborder\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: none !important; vertical-align: top;\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://2027.sigmod.org/\">SIGMOD/PODS 2027 Conference (Call for Papers)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://2026.sigmod.org/\">SIGMOD/PODS 2026 Conference</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://2025.sigmod.org/\">SIGMOD/PODS 2025 Conference (Last Conference)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sigmodrecord.org/\">SIGMOD Record</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://wp.sigmod.org/\">The SIGMOD Blog</a></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: none !important; vertical-align: top;\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://sigmod.org/acm-open-sigmod/\">ACM Open</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sigmod.org/sigmod-awards\">SIGMOD Awards</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://reproducibility.sigmod.org/\">SIGMOD Reproducibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sigmod.org/videoseries\">SIGMOD Video Series</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sigmod.org/sigmod-policies/dbcares-policy/\">DBCares</a></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1500838901567\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner vc_custom_1422002848621\">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_raw_cod